      "message": "That doesn\u0027t build. Even without checking the temp sensor count, temp_sensor_read won\u0027t be defined unless CONFIG_TEMP_SENSOR is. When I changed this to an IS_ENABLED guard, it lead to build issues with panqueque, hayato, gingerbread, marzipan, mrbland and waddledoo.",
